## Summary
Pearl Abyss's Q2 earnings declined as the initial boost from Crimson Desert's March launch wore off. The game's launch period impact subsided, leading to weaker quarterly performance. This decline suggests the game's revenue peaked shortly after launch.

## Key Points
- Pearl Abyss Q2 earnings declined
- Crimson Desert's launch impact subsided post-March
- Weaker quarterly performance due to post-launch decline


